    {
      "question_id": "r19_taper_capacity",
      "question": "锥台杯上下端内径70 mm和60 mm、有效液高100 mm，如何计算理想容量？复杂曲面如何改变方法？",
      "snapshot_id": "c9c97ed4f80ae388",
      "allowed_citations": [
        "L1",
        "L2",
        "L3",
        "L4",
        "L5",
